sequenceDiagram
    title Protected call: add a transaction (POST /api/transactions)
    actor User
    participant FE as Frontend<br/>TransactionForm<br/>api.js
    participant LS as Browser<br/>localStorage
    participant AU as Backend<br/>authenticate<br/>middleware
    participant BE as Backend<br/>routes<br/>TransactionService
    participant DB as Database<br/>repositories<br/>SQLite

    User->>FE: Fill in the form, click Add expense
    FE->>LS: Read token
    LS-->>FE: token
    FE->>AU: POST /api/transactions { amount, type, categoryId, date, note }<br/>Authorization: Bearer token
    AU->>AU: jwt.verify(token, TOKEN_SECRET)
    AU->>DB: Find the token's user
    DB-->>AU: User, or nothing

    alt Missing, invalid, or expired token, or user no longer exists
        AU-->>FE: 401 { error }
        FE->>LS: Clear token
        FE-->>User: Return to the login page
    else Valid token
        AU->>BE: Continue with req.userId from the token
        BE->>DB: Find the category for this user only
        DB-->>BE: Category, or nothing
        alt Invalid data, or the category isn't this user's
            BE-->>FE: 400 { error, details: [reasons] }
            FE-->>User: Show the reasons on the form
        else Valid data
            BE->>DB: INSERT transaction with user_id = req.userId
            DB-->>BE: New transaction
            BE-->>FE: 201 { transaction }
            FE->>AU: GET /api/budgets/summary, /api/transactions, /api/categories,<br/>and /api/reports/spending-by-category, each with Authorization: Bearer token
            Note over FE,DB: Each request goes through the same token check,<br/>and every query filters by user_id
            AU-->>FE: 200 with this user's data only
            FE-->>User: Totals, chart, budget bars, and the list update
        end
    end
